## A uniform histogram with `bins` buckets.
##
## **Signature:** `histogram : (Tensor<1, Scalar<ρ,d>>, Int) -> { counts: Tensor<1, Int>, edges: Tensor<1, Scalar<ρ,d>> }`
##
## Returns `(counts, edges)`; `edges` has `bins + 1` entries spanning the
